          "description": "A free, safe, family friendly bike ride throughout Franklin Park and surrounding neighborhoods on Sunday, October 11, 8:30am to 2:00pm. Choose a 9-mile route, a 2.5-mile route, or a 0.5-mile loop for beginners and balance-bikers, or take a fitness class instead. A festival at the Shattuck Picnic Area includes free bike programming, dance and fitness classes, a bike repair clinic, a local DJ, live music, and food vendors. Registration through Eventbrite; sponsored by Wayfair and Blue Cross Blue Shield.",
